The '''Camp Banyo''' ("Little Baths Field") is a multi-use [[W:Stadium|stadium]] in [[Navassa]], [[Balisca]]. It is the largest sports facility in Navassa and the home ground of [[Atlètic Navaza]] [[Atlètic Navaza|F.C.]] The stadium was first opened in 1929 and takes its name from the surrounding barrio, [[Banyoles]], which means "little baths" in reference to the [[W:Thermal bath|thermal baths]] nearby. 

